The lesson also connects star schema to a realistic DataSensei activity. Students should predict the result before running or completing the example, compare the prediction with the observed result, and explain any difference. The final interpretation should state what the result means, what it does not prove, and what additional evidence may be needed.',
                'code' => 'SELECT d.month_name, SUM(f.sales_amount) AS total_sales
